WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:01.240
Mr Bennett-

00:00:02.180 --> 00:00:03.520
Mr Blumenthal-

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:06.000
Mr Blunt-

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.640
Americans know that we face a fiscal crisis
not because we tax too little

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:13.620
but because we spend too much.

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:19.080
We want to work with the president to restrain
federal spending.

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:24.180
The real problem here is the debt and the
lack of a credible plan to deal with the debt.

00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:27.540
We are spending money we don't have

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:32.140
and there is a real lack of common sense in
the capitol.

